================================================================================
PART C: ROLLING WINDOW CALCULATION : GREEDY STITCHING (e.g., "Last 7 days")
================================================================================
[ START: Calculate Utilized Amount for last 15 Days]
    |
    V
+-------------------------------------------------+
| Initialize:                                     |
|  - TotalSum = 0                                 |
|  - RemainingWindow = 15 Days, 0 Hours           |
+-------------------------------------------------+
    |
    | (Assume current time is W37, Day 5, 12:00)
    V
< Get data from current PARTIAL week (W37) >
|  - Amount = GetTotal("W37")                     |
|  - Duration = 5 Days, 12 Hours                  |
+-------------------------------------------------+
    |
    V
+-------------------------------------------------+
| Update:                                         |
|  - TotalSum += Amount                           |
|  - RemainingWindow -= Duration                  |
|  (Now RemainingWindow = 9 Days, 12 Hours)       |
+-------------------------------------------------+
    |
    V
< Get data from previous FULL week (W36) >
|  - Amount = GetTotal("W36")                     |
|  - Duration = 7 Days                            |
+-------------------------------------------------+
    |
    V
+-------------------------------------------------+
| Update:                                         |
|  - TotalSum += Amount                           |
|  - RemainingWindow -= Duration                  |
|  (Now RemainingWindow = 2 Days, 12 Hours)       |
+-------------------------------------------------+
    |
    V
< Get data from 2 previous FULL days >
|  - Amount = GetTotal("DayX") + GetTotal("DayY") |
|  - Duration = 2 Days                            |
+-------------------------------------------------+
    |
    V
+-------------------------------------------------+
| Update:                                         |
|  - TotalSum += Amount                           |
|  - RemainingWindow -= Duration                  |
|  (Now RemainingWindow = 0 Days, 12 Hours)       |
+-------------------------------------------------+
    |
    V
< Get data from 12 previous FULL hours >
|  - Amount = SUM(GetTotal("Hour1..12"))          |
|  - Duration = 12 Hours                          |
+-------------------------------------------------+
    |
    V
+-------------------------------------------------+
| Update:                                         |
|  - TotalSum += Amount                           |
|  - RemainingWindow -= Duration                  |
|  (Now RemainingWindow = 0)                      |
+-------------------------------------------------+
    |
    V
[ END: Return Final TotalSum ]